Z||000006||Gold87SE||08-09-2001||10:11 PM||||It was at night and I went right home. The noise did sound like the fuel pump but really loud. When I started the car the next day, it still made the noise. I drove about a 1/4 mile and ran out of gas. The gauge told me that I had 1/8 of a tank left. When I filled it up, the noise went away so that answered my question.<P>Is it common for the fuel pump to whine really loud when you're just about out of gas?<P>------------------<BR>- 1987 SE (Gold)<BR>- 1987 GT (Maroon)||||reg||1
